# Code owners for mattermost-mcp.
#
# Branch protection on `main` requires a code-owner review on every PR
# (require_code_owner_reviews). Since an author cannot approve their own PR,
# this means a second owner reviews — listing two owners means EITHER owner's
# approval satisfies the requirement. enforce_admins is OFF, so an admin can
# still merge directly when no reviewer is available.
#
# Owners must be collaborators with write/admin.

